", then " = "，然后运行 ";
"<share>/projects|xcode-archives|files/<name>/<date-time>/ holds the copy and manifest.json. Folders (projects, archives, app bundles) are stored as one standard tar file — keeps symlinks, permissions, extended attributes, long and odd names and case intact, and is much faster over SMB than thousands of small files. Single files are copied as they are, with SMB-safe names; their real name and attributes are in the manifest. A folder ending in “.partial” is an incomplete copy." = "副本和 manifest.json 清单位于 <share>/projects|xcode-archives|files/<name>/<date-time>/。项目、归档和应用程序包会存为标准 tar 文件，保留符号链接、权限、扩展属性、长文件名、特殊文件名及大小写。相比通过 SMB 复制大量小文件，这样更快。单个文件会原样复制，并调整为 SMB 支持的名称。原名称和属性保存在清单里。名称以“.partial”结尾的是未完成的副本。";
"`cargo fetch` / next build; `rustup toolchain install <name>`." = "运行 cargo fetch 或重新构建。工具链用 rustup toolchain install <name> 恢复。";
"`nvm install <version>`, then reinstall any global packages you used with it." = "运行 nvm install <version>，再安装曾使用的全局软件包。";
"`pnpm install` in each project re-downloads what it needs." = "在各项目中运行 pnpm install，重新下载所需软件包。";
"A couple of minutes to recreate + cold boot; data inside is lost." = "重新创建和冷启动需要几分钟，模拟器内的数据会丢失。";
"A few minutes of \"Copying shared cache symbols\" per device + OS." = "每种设备和系统版本的组合都需要花几分钟复制共享缓存符号。";
"a full first build" = "下一次需要完整构建。";
