"Next package resolution re-clones dependency repositories and re-downloads binary artifacts. Projects keep their own checkouts in .build / DerivedData." = "下次解析软件包时会重新克隆依赖仓库并重新下载二进制产物。各项目在 .build 或 DerivedData 中的副本会保留。";
