"That Node version and its globally installed npm packages (CLIs like pnpm, eas, vercel) are gone. Projects pinned to it via .nvmrc need `nvm install` again." = "该 Node 版本和通过它全局安装的 npm 软件包（如 pnpm、eas、vercel 等命令行工具）都会被移除。通过 .nvmrc 固定此版本的项目需重新运行 nvm install。";
"The emulator and everything in it (installed apps, data, snapshots, Google sign-in) is gone. You'd recreate it in Device Manager and reinstall your app." = "模拟器及其中的应用、数据、快照和 Google 登录状态都会删除。需在设备管理器中新建模拟器并重新安装应用。";
"The IDE re-indexes your projects on next open (CPU-heavy for a few minutes, search/completion degraded meanwhile). Local History lives here too and is lost. Old versions' caches are pure leftovers once you've upgraded." = "下次打开时，IDE 会重新索引项目，几分钟内 CPU 占用较高，搜索和补全也会受影响。这里还存放 Local History，清理时会一并删除。升级后，旧版本缓存通常可清理。";
"The original of each item stays where it is until its copy on the NAS has been verified." = "每项在 NAS 上的副本通过校验后，原件才会被移动。";
"The simulator and everything installed in it (apps, their data, keychain, settings, photos) is gone. You'd recreate the device in Xcode and reinstall your app; first boot of a new device is slow." = "模拟器及其中的应用、数据、钥匙串、设置和照片都会丢失。需在 Xcode 中重新创建设备和安装应用。新设备首次启动较慢。";
"The Trash and some app caches can't be measured until you allow it. Add Major Tom, then come back." = "获得权限后才能统计废纸篓和部分应用缓存。请添加 Major Tom，然后返回。";
"These are your own files: videos, disk images, exports, VMs, apps you dragged out of a download. Nothing regenerates them. Each goes to the Trash, so you can put it back until you empty it." = "这些是你自己的视频、磁盘映像、导出文件、虚拟机或从下载中拖出的应用，无法自动重建。它们会移到废纸篓，清倒前可以放回。";
